commit 6c562d12d9cbc832ef0a3144f0adc970234d3a53

C03: named public sites open by navigation; andá as a request head (WEB1257 repair)

«Abre youtube», «abrí gmail» and «abre Gmail» resolved to nothing because a
public service name only navigated with a browser word or «la página de…»,
and «andá a github.com» lost its bare domain because «andá» was not a direct
request head. The closed list youtube/gmail/github/chatgpt now navigates to
the canonical destination the argument builder already knew for youtube,
BBC and CNN; searched destinations («andá a youtube», «llevame a github»)
keep the verified web.search before browser.navigate.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>


